{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>多人懷疑信用卡被盜用預訂蘋果新手機的案件，警方最新接獲多10幾宗報案。<br/></p><p>警方稱截至今日早上九時，共接獲130人報案，涉款增至500萬元，案件暫列以欺騙手段取得財產。</p><p></p><p>蘋果公司首款摺機IPHONE DUO上周五晚接受網上預訂，但未有啟用3DS交易認證。蘋果指所有訂單處理前都會審核，並取消任何欺詐交易。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T04:19:07.711686+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T03:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T09:18:11.432196+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T04:17:35.179012+00:00","content_hash":"07733b925879eb7685f12ef84e224aa7dade210d6131a7d7a6b83342286b1f36","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}